#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/explanation/index.md:8
msgid "Architecture explanations"
msgstr "架构解释"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/explanation/index.md:10
msgid ""
"Understand boundaries, static assembly and retained storage before changing "
"a provider. The linked design contracts remain authoritative."
msgstr "修改提供者前，先理解边界、静态装配和必须保留的存储。链接的设计合同仍是规范依据。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/explanation/index.md:12
msgid ""
"The [I/O evolution design](../design/io-evolution.md) explains resource "
"plans, optional traits and enhanced data contracts; its execution ledger "
"keeps current and pending work separate."
msgstr ""
"[I/O 增量架构](../design/io-evolution.md)说明资源计划、可选 traits "
"与增强数据合同；对应台账分别保留当前实现和待完成工作。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/explanation/index.md:16
msgid ""
"The [H743 Flash RAM design](../design/h743-flash-ram.md) explains the "
"selected V/cache-off maintenance boundary: a private CPU bridge, RAM vector "
"owner, temporary MPU protection and real drain before return. The source is "
"integrated; the target diagrams retain open production-ELF and complete "
"software exits."
msgstr ""
"[H743 Flash RAM 设计](../design/h743-flash-ram.md)说明选定 V／Cache off 的维护边界：私有 "
"CPU bridge、RAM 向量 owner、临时 MPU 保护，以及返回前的真实排空。源代码已接入；目标图所要求的生产 ELF "
"与完整软件退出仍未完成。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/explanation/index.md:21
msgid ""
"The [RTC/LPTIM explanation](rtc-lptim.md) separates raw calendar, finite "
"counter and Core deadline domains. It covers current Native typed assembly, "
"ownership, drain and explicit lifecycle; physical RTC/LPTIM and low-power "
"support remain separate targets."
msgstr ""
"[RTC/LPTIM 说明](rtc-lptim.md)区分原始日历、有限计数与 Core deadline 域。本文解释当前 Native "
"类型化装配、所有权、排空和显式生命周期；物理 RTC/LPTIM 与低功耗支持仍是独立目标。"

#: ../../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-spi-safe-stop-20261018/docs/explanation/index.md:23
msgid ""
"The [GPIO pin-state explanation](gpio-pin-states.md) separates explicit GPIO"
" images from factory identity, cold pad/gate ownership and checked cleanup. "
"Its current G474 reference does not provide wake, retention or hardware low-"
"power qualification."
msgstr ""
"[GPIO 引脚状态说明](gpio-pin-states.md)将显式 GPIO 图像与 factory 身份、冷态 pad/gate "
"所有权及受检查的清理分开解释。其当前 G474 参考范围不提供 wake、retention 或硬件低功耗资格。"
